"text": "The standing lint entries run first. Next come the unit layer and then the new cases by name, then the integration and E2E layers. A preservation guard guards the modify list, against base `f23586fbda77` (HEAD at P4). The release build the switch runs on comes next, then the booted smoke, G2, G4 and `pre-push`, then the operator pass. The three evidence readers come last."
},
